  m_Name: Carta_DronesDeEntregaUrbana
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Metis.Runtime::KnowledgeEntryData
  _title: Drones de Entrega Urbana
  _titleEn: Urban Delivery Drones
  _category: 0
  _unlockTrigger: 0
  _summary: "Drones entregam pacotes pequenos pelo ar, sem enfrentar o tr\xE2nsito."
  _summaryEn: Drones deliver small packages by air without facing traffic.
  _realWorld: "A Zipline come\xE7ou em 2016 a levar bolsas de sangue por drone a
    hospitais de Ruanda e depois expandiu para outros pa\xEDses."
  _realWorldEn: Zipline began flying blood supplies by drone to hospitals in Rwanda
    in 2016 and later expanded to other countries.
  _tradeOffs: "Drones fazem barulho, levantam quest\xF5es de privacidade e seguran\xE7a
    a\xE9rea e tiram empregos de entregadores."
  _tradeOffsEn: Drones are noisy, raise privacy and air safety concerns and take
    jobs from delivery workers.
